    "subject": "feat(addon): Readies addon service layer for project addon route",
    "message": "feat(addon): Readies addon service layer for project addon route\n\n`createAddon`, `updateAddon` and `removeAddon` take an optional trailing\nproject. When project is set, the addon must belong to exactly that\nproject. This will be used by the controller later to enable addons as a\nproject resource `/api/admin/projects/:projectId/addons`.\n\nThis commit contains changes to the service layer, and tests for those\nchanges. Currently not in use by the controller."
