    "subject": "refactor(playground): Move complex single-feature query into a new read model",
    "message": "refactor(playground): Move complex single-feature query into a new read model\n\nThe team's architectural guidance suggests that stores remain CRUD-like\nand simple, and that complex multi-table queries are moved to a Read\nmodel.\n\nThis PR moves the query that gets a feature and its parent (if any) and\nmoves it to a new read model. Wiring up the read model into the service\nis left for a follow-up PR.\n\n---\n\n<sub>Stack created with <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/github/gh-stack\">GitHub Stacks CLI</a> • <a\nhref=\"https://gh.io/stacks-feedback\">Give Feedback 💬</a></sub>"
